## On trigger

- `domain_rules.md`: DTO/Entity/Mapper/VO/enum/API.
- `ui_rules.md`: any presentation boundary.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: operation with an error result or error flow.
- `auth_rules.md`: auth, session, role, permission, guard, or redirect.
- `security_rules.md`: secret, PII, sensitive storage, or logs.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

## References

- `domain_examples.md`: non-trivial mapping/copyWith.
- `api_contract_reference.md`: endpoint, payload, pagination, or backend code.
- `project-rules/contracts/*.openapi.json`: REST integration — consult-only; do not mutate.
- Omit this section when there is no actionable reference.
